WEBVTT

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.903
Roar.

00:00:04.903 --> 00:00:05.953
Aah!

00:00:05.953 --> 00:00:07.003
Gobble, gobble,
gobble, gobble.

00:00:07.003 --> 00:00:08.053
[COUNTRY MUSIC]

00:00:09.433 --> 00:00:12.113
No, no, no, no, no.

00:00:12.113 --> 00:00:13.893
Aah!
Duke, what did I do?

00:00:13.893 --> 00:00:14.953
What did I do?

00:00:14.953 --> 00:00:16.923
Gobble, gobble,
gobble, gobble.

00:00:16.923 --> 00:00:18.193
[LOUD BARK]

00:00:18.193 --> 00:00:19.243
Gobble?

00:00:19.243 --> 00:00:20.903
Moo?

00:00:20.903 --> 00:00:22.173
Huh?

00:00:22.173 --> 00:00:23.223
Hmm.

00:00:24.793 --> 00:00:25.843
Gobble.

00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:28.933
Gobble, gobble, gobble.

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:31.573
Whoa.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:32.973
[TRIANGLE SOUND]

00:00:32.973 --> 00:00:34.023
Huh?

00:00:35.313 --> 00:00:37.653
Dinner's on.

00:00:37.653 --> 00:00:39.523
[MYSTERIOUS MUSIC]

00:00:43.413 --> 00:00:44.583
Chloe?

00:00:44.583 --> 00:00:46.043
I need your help.

00:00:46.043 --> 00:00:47.493
Chloe?

00:00:47.493 --> 00:00:48.543
Oh.

00:00:48.543 --> 00:00:51.153
Oh.

00:00:51.153 --> 00:00:52.403
Chloe?
Chloe?

00:00:52.403 --> 00:00:53.453
Are you OK--

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:55.623
Shh.

00:00:55.623 --> 00:00:56.673
Sorry.

00:00:56.673 --> 00:00:59.143
I'm just, I'm-- real quick.

00:00:59.143 --> 00:01:01.593
Why is there a
lampshade on your head?

00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:02.673
Listen.

00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:04.323
Gidget, baby.

00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:05.973
I got to be honest with you.

00:01:05.973 --> 00:01:10.113
My owner might have given
me a little bit of catnip.

00:01:10.113 --> 00:01:12.043
[CHUCKLES] Whoa.

00:01:12.043 --> 00:01:13.863
[LAUGHS]

00:01:13.863 --> 00:01:15.003
Oh, OK.
Gotcha.

00:01:15.003 --> 00:01:16.053
That's great.

00:01:16.053 --> 00:01:17.103
Um, listen--

00:01:17.103 --> 00:01:18.573
It is great, Gidget.

00:01:18.573 --> 00:01:20.423
Everything is great.

00:01:20.423 --> 00:01:21.473
All right.

00:01:21.473 --> 00:01:22.623
[PURRING]

00:01:22.623 --> 00:01:23.673
Do you hear that?

00:01:23.673 --> 00:01:24.873
Hear what?

00:01:24.873 --> 00:01:26.133
It's like-- it's like a tiny--

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:27.603
like a tiny motor?

00:01:27.603 --> 00:01:28.653
It's like humming sound.

00:01:28.653 --> 00:01:30.213
[PURRING]

00:01:30.213 --> 00:01:32.703
I'm not-- I don't
know what you're--

00:01:32.703 --> 00:01:34.253
Oh, Chloe, you're purring.

00:01:34.253 --> 00:01:36.093
[LAUGHS] That's you.

00:01:36.093 --> 00:01:37.143
What?

00:01:37.143 --> 00:01:38.523
That's me?

00:01:38.523 --> 00:01:41.313
Like, as in the sound is
coming from inside of me?

00:01:41.313 --> 00:01:42.363
Yup.

00:01:42.363 --> 00:01:43.413
Oh.

00:01:43.413 --> 00:01:45.483
I wonder what other
sounds I could make.

00:01:45.483 --> 00:01:46.803
Meow.

00:01:46.803 --> 00:01:49.553
It's just, Max trusted me
to look after his busy bee.

00:01:49.553 --> 00:01:50.603
And then--
[LOUD PURR]

00:01:50.603 --> 00:01:51.653
Ugh.

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:52.803
Chloe, would you listen?

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:54.563
Meow.

00:01:54.563 --> 00:01:55.613
Wow.

00:01:55.613 --> 00:01:56.663
Please stop.

00:01:56.663 --> 00:02:01.473
[PURR-MEOW]

00:02:01.473 --> 00:02:02.803
Are you finished?

00:02:02.803 --> 00:02:04.173
[KISSING]

00:02:04.173 --> 00:02:05.523
This is important.

00:02:05.523 --> 00:02:07.593
I lost busy bee.

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:09.073
I got to get it back.

00:02:09.073 --> 00:02:13.413
But to do that, Chloe,
[SIGHS] I need you

00:02:13.413 --> 00:02:17.403
to teach me the way of the cat.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.453
[CAREFREE MUSIC]

00:02:18.453 --> 00:02:20.663
[BARK] Here I come.

00:02:20.663 --> 00:02:22.333
I'm going to get you.

00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:23.383
Oh!

00:02:23.383 --> 00:02:24.733
Urg.

00:02:24.733 --> 00:02:26.283
[PANTING] Oh.

00:02:26.283 --> 00:02:29.793
[BARKING] Max, come on.

00:02:29.793 --> 00:02:31.023
Try to catch a fire fly.

00:02:31.023 --> 00:02:32.793
I'm just-- that sounds great.

00:02:32.793 --> 00:02:34.723
But I think Liam
wants me near him.

00:02:34.723 --> 00:02:38.773
You know, he's a little freaked
out being in this weird place.

00:02:38.773 --> 00:02:40.623
I think he'll be OK.

00:02:40.623 --> 00:02:43.563
And this one is
in a [INAUDIBLE]..

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:45.303
Oh, OK.
Just one.

00:02:45.303 --> 00:02:46.803
- [LAUGHS]
- Ah!

00:02:46.803 --> 00:02:47.853
Ah!

00:02:47.853 --> 00:02:49.733
Yes, I-- ugh!

00:02:49.733 --> 00:02:50.783
Ugh.

00:02:50.783 --> 00:02:51.833
Ugh, ugh, ugh.

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:52.883
Ugh.

00:02:52.883 --> 00:02:54.023
Oh.

00:02:54.023 --> 00:02:56.283
Aaah.

00:02:56.283 --> 00:02:59.143
[SPITS] [LAPPING]

00:02:59.143 --> 00:03:00.193
ROOSTER: [GROWLING]

00:03:00.193 --> 00:03:02.153
[SCARY MUSIC]

00:03:02.153 --> 00:03:03.623
Ah!

00:03:03.623 --> 00:03:05.963
Oh, Hello.

00:03:05.963 --> 00:03:08.243
Dog's got two
things in this life.

00:03:08.243 --> 00:03:11.063
His water bowl, and his dignity.

00:03:11.063 --> 00:03:14.023
You take one, you
take the other.

00:03:14.023 --> 00:03:16.823
I-- I didn't know
this was your bowl.

00:03:16.823 --> 00:03:18.753
What, the cone
blocking your view?

00:03:18.753 --> 00:03:21.733
It's got my name on the side.

00:03:21.733 --> 00:03:25.063
We are so sorry, Mr. Chicken?

00:03:25.063 --> 00:03:26.623
Name's not chicken.

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:27.953
Do I look like a chicken to you?
- No.

00:03:27.953 --> 00:03:29.003
No, sir.

00:03:29.003 --> 00:03:31.363
No. not even a little.

00:03:31.363 --> 00:03:32.893
Name's Rooster.
LIAM: [GIGGLING]

00:03:32.893 --> 00:03:33.943
Oh.
OK.

00:03:33.943 --> 00:03:35.183
I'm Max.
And this is--

00:03:35.183 --> 00:03:37.573
Hey, what's that
kid doing in the cage?

00:03:37.573 --> 00:03:38.623
Something wrong with him?

00:03:38.623 --> 00:03:39.673
He got the fever?

00:03:39.673 --> 00:03:41.203
[LAUGHING]

00:03:41.203 --> 00:03:42.313
That's-- that's Liam.

00:03:42.313 --> 00:03:44.053
He-- he likes to run.

00:03:44.053 --> 00:03:45.643
So let him run.

00:03:45.643 --> 00:03:47.723
Well, Liam's super fast.

00:03:47.723 --> 00:03:49.703
We-- we-- we blink,
and he's up a tree.

00:03:49.703 --> 00:03:51.273
So then, your kid's up a tree.

00:03:51.273 --> 00:03:52.513
What's the problem?

00:03:52.513 --> 00:03:54.403
- Well, he could fall.
- He might.

00:03:54.403 --> 00:03:55.543
And then, he hurts himself.

00:03:55.543 --> 00:03:56.593
Oh.

00:03:56.593 --> 00:03:58.933
So he got really high up
in this hypothetical tree.

00:03:58.933 --> 00:03:59.983
I--

00:03:59.983 --> 00:04:01.033
Kid gets hurt.

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:02.293
He learns not to do it again.

00:04:02.293 --> 00:04:04.903
You know how many electric
cords I've chewed?

00:04:04.903 --> 00:04:07.783
Like, multiple cords?

00:04:07.783 --> 00:04:09.013
One.

00:04:09.013 --> 00:04:10.493
It shocked me.

00:04:10.493 --> 00:04:11.953
I walked backward for a week.

00:04:11.953 --> 00:04:14.053
But I never chewed a cord again.

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:15.913
Well, that is great for you.

00:04:15.913 --> 00:04:17.683
And it explains a lot.

00:04:17.683 --> 00:04:22.263
But I like to protect
Liam from everything.

00:04:22.263 --> 00:04:23.823
[CHUCKLES] Well, that's you.

00:04:23.823 --> 00:04:24.873
And you're wrong.

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:28.383
Oh.

00:04:28.383 --> 00:04:29.433
Can you believe that guy?

00:04:29.433 --> 00:04:30.483
Yeah.

00:04:30.483 --> 00:04:31.923
He was cool.

00:04:31.923 --> 00:04:33.243
No, he wasn't.

00:04:33.243 --> 00:04:34.293
I know.

00:04:34.293 --> 00:04:35.853
He wasn't cool at all.

00:04:35.853 --> 00:04:36.903
KATIE: No, I'll do the dishes.

00:04:36.903 --> 00:04:37.953
[CHEERFUL MUSIC]

00:04:37.953 --> 00:04:39.273
Come on.

00:04:39.273 --> 00:04:40.323
Let's get this guy inside.

00:04:43.663 --> 00:04:44.713
Whoa.

00:04:44.713 --> 00:04:45.763
Hold up there.

00:04:45.763 --> 00:04:47.413
Dogs sleep outside.

00:04:47.413 --> 00:04:48.463
Uh, pardon?

00:04:48.463 --> 00:04:49.573
- Huh?
- Whoa.

00:04:49.573 --> 00:04:50.623
Whoa.
Whoa.

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:51.943
Whoa.
OK.

00:04:51.943 --> 00:04:52.993
Wait.
Wait.

00:04:52.993 --> 00:04:56.543
Let's talk about
this like rational--

00:04:56.543 --> 00:04:58.423
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:05:01.023 --> 00:05:02.073
All right.

00:05:02.073 --> 00:05:03.123
We're here.

00:05:03.123 --> 00:05:06.573
In record time too, Thanks
to the bunny mobile.

00:05:06.573 --> 00:05:07.833
Oh yeah.

00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:08.883
[THUNDER]

00:05:08.883 --> 00:05:10.113
Stealth mode.

00:05:10.113 --> 00:05:12.523
Let's go.

00:05:12.523 --> 00:05:13.983
[THUNDER]

00:05:16.363 --> 00:05:17.413
Ah!

00:05:20.763 --> 00:05:21.813
Ya!

00:05:21.813 --> 00:05:22.863
Hua!

00:05:26.143 --> 00:05:27.193
Ya!

00:05:27.193 --> 00:05:28.583
Ba-da-ba-da-ba-da-ba.

00:05:28.583 --> 00:05:29.633
Oh!

00:05:29.633 --> 00:05:30.683
[THUNDER]

00:05:30.683 --> 00:05:33.073
Aah!

00:05:33.073 --> 00:05:34.513
You are jumpy.

00:05:34.513 --> 00:05:36.803
I meant, aah, that's cool.

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:40.303
Or, aah, look that thing I'm
not scared of right there.

00:05:40.303 --> 00:05:41.783
Or aah.

00:05:41.783 --> 00:05:43.383
There's a candy
wrapper on the ground.

00:05:43.383 --> 00:05:44.433
See?

00:05:44.433 --> 00:05:46.113
It's just a thing I do.

00:05:46.113 --> 00:05:47.233
Aah.

00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:48.283
[WHIP]

00:05:48.283 --> 00:05:49.623
SERGEI: Come on,
you stupid tiger.

00:05:49.623 --> 00:05:50.673
[WHIP]

00:05:50.673 --> 00:05:52.233
There he is.
Let's go.

00:05:52.233 --> 00:05:53.283
Ah!

00:05:53.283 --> 00:05:54.503
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:05:54.503 --> 00:05:56.453
SERGEI: We don't
have entire night.

00:05:56.453 --> 00:05:58.273
[WHIP]

00:05:58.273 --> 00:05:59.323
[WHIP]

00:05:59.323 --> 00:06:00.373
[WHIP]

00:06:00.373 --> 00:06:01.723
HU: [WHIMPER]

00:06:01.723 --> 00:06:02.963
Let's go!

00:06:02.963 --> 00:06:04.493
[WHIMPER]
[SAD MUSIC]

00:06:04.493 --> 00:06:06.033
You're wasting Sergei's time.

00:06:06.033 --> 00:06:07.083
[WHIP]

00:06:07.083 --> 00:06:10.363
[WHIMPER]

00:06:10.363 --> 00:06:11.933
We got to do something.
[WHIP]

00:06:11.933 --> 00:06:13.323
Oh!

00:06:13.323 --> 00:06:15.173
Oh!

00:06:15.173 --> 00:06:16.643
Oh!
- OK, all right.

00:06:16.643 --> 00:06:17.693
- Here.
- Get him.

00:06:17.693 --> 00:06:18.743
- Come on.
- Whoa.

00:06:18.743 --> 00:06:20.403
- Wait.
- Ah.

00:06:20.403 --> 00:06:21.453
Get him.

00:06:21.453 --> 00:06:22.853
Come on.

00:06:22.853 --> 00:06:27.253
[WHIMPER]

00:06:27.253 --> 00:06:29.173
We try again tomorrow.

00:06:29.173 --> 00:06:33.073
If tiger does not do trick,
tiger will become rug.

00:06:33.073 --> 00:06:34.323
[MONKEY SOUND]

00:06:34.323 --> 00:06:37.013
[WHIMPER]

00:06:37.013 --> 00:06:40.033
Do not let tiger
out of your sight.

00:06:40.033 --> 00:06:42.023
[GROWLS]

